{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Centuries ago, a devouring mist abruptly descended, shrouding the eastern continent of Ethelyon and leaving behind only cursed remnants and death. Since then, no one has dared to set foot on this land. Now, a ship carries \u200b<strong>an</strong>\u200b advance team \u200b<strong>from a united investigation force</strong>\u200b towards this \u200b<strong>cursed</strong>\u200b forbidden zone\u2014though each member has their own purpose, they find their fates intertwined here. \u200b<strong>But</strong>\u200b do curse and death truly signify the end? Perhaps, this is merely the beginning of another unknown journey. An adventure to lift the curse is about to unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the world of <i>Dominion Of The Forgotten</i>, you can choose to embark on a heroic journey alone or fight alongside up to two companions. Whether exploring solo or \u200b<strong>cooperating with others</strong>, both \u200b<strong>styles</strong>\u200b offer distinct yet equally thrilling adventure experiences.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3825860?t=1757478212","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3825860?t=1757478212","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825860/6395a471492966d27feaebd99b3cdee8251cc6bb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757478212","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825860/6395a471492966d27feaebd99b3cdee8251cc6bb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757478212","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Centuries ago, a devouring mist abruptly descended, shrouding the eastern continent of Ethelyon and leaving behind only cursed remnants and death. Since then, no one has dared to set foot on this land. Now, a ship carries \u200b<strong>an</strong>\u200b advance team \u200b<strong>from a united investigation force</strong>\u200b towards this \u200b<strong>cursed</strong>\u200b forbidden zone\u2014though each member has their own purpose, they find their fates intertwined here. \u200b<strong>But</strong>\u200b do curse and death truly signify the end? Perhaps, this is merely the beginning of another unknown journey. An adventure to lift the curse is about to unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the world of <i>Dominion Of The Forgotten</i>, you can choose to embark on a heroic journey alone or fight alongside up to two companions. Whether exploring solo or \u200b<strong>cooperating with others</strong>, both \u200b<strong>styles</strong>\u200b offer distinct yet equally thrilling adventure experiences.</p>","developers":["\u611a\u661f\u79d1\u6280"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825860/e6cc10761097bafb3f53d4a46bf0162577bb86b2/header.jpg?t=1757478212","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257195443,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257195443/movie480.mp4?t=1757475977","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257195443/movie_max.mp4?t=1757475977"},"name":"\u5931\u843d\u6743\u67c41","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257195443/7745fed24a0f4dbf5f3d4a7f786451fd5610dd17/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757475977","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257195443/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1757475977","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257195443/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1757475977"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257195